Blinkered word list for English (en)
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

This file is generated. It is not a copy of any dictionary. It is the list of words that
appear in a frequency-ordered corpus of en AND are accepted by every validator
below, filtered to what the game can deal as tiles. Neither input is redistributed here.
Rebuild it with `pnpm dictionary build --language=en`.

Distributed under MIT, which is the most restrictive of the terms below. See
PROVENANCE.md for what was relied on and why.

Ordering
  hermitdave/FrequencyWords, from the OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus via OPUS
  MIT

Validation
  hunspell `en` (MIT) — SCOWL, Kevin Atkinson and contributors
  hunspell `en-GB` (MIT) — SCOWL, Kevin Atkinson and contributors
  word list `enable1` (LicenseRef-public-domain) — ENABLE (Enhanced North American Benchmark Lexicon), Alan Beale and M. Cooper, released into the public domain; see the YAWL package LICENSE for the statement

The full text of each license is in ../licenses/.
